                <div class="title-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-folder-tree"></i></div>
                3. Project Directory Architecture
            </h2>
            <p>All developer templates (.one files), stylesheets, scripts, and assets live inside the <strong>`public/`</strong> directory:</p>

            <div class="code-window">
                <div class="code-header">
                    <div class="code-dots"><div class="dot dot-red"></div><div class="dot dot-yellow"></div><div class="dot dot-green"></div></div>
                    <div class="code-filename">Project Structure</div>
                </div>
                <div class="code-block">
my-website/
├── <span class="code-val">public/</span>                   <span class="code-comment">&lt;-- All developer templates (.one), CSS, JS, images</span>
│   ├── index.one             <span class="code-comment">&lt;-- Homepage template (URL: /)</span>
│   ├── products.one          <span class="code-comment">&lt;-- Product listing (URL: /products)</span>
│   ├── docs.one              <span class="code-comment">&lt;-- Documentation Page (URL: /docs)</span>
│   ├── includes/             <span class="code-comment">&lt;-- Header & Footer Components</span>
│   ├── css/                  <span class="code-comment">&lt;-- Stylesheets</span>
│   └── images/               <span class="code-comment">&lt;-- Image Assets</span>
│
├── <span class="code-attr">config.one</span>                <span class="code-comment">&lt;-- Database Configuration</span>
├── <span class="code-tag">onescript/</span>                <span class="code-comment">&lt;-- Core Hidden Engine Directory</span>
└── <span class="code-directive">.htaccess</span>                 <span class="code-comment">&lt;-- Server Routing Rules</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

