            </h2>
            <p>Deploying OneScript to cPanel shared hosting requires zero server configuration:</p>

            <ol>
                <li>Compress your project files into a zip file.</li>
                <li>Upload and extract into your cPanel <strong>`public_html`</strong> directory.</li>
                <li>Open <code>config.one</code> and enter your MySQL database name and credentials.</li>
            </ol>

            <p>Your website is now 100% live on your domain!</p>
